# Full playthrough, title screen to the sportsman ending (see README.md).
#
#   zig-out/bin/noite --headless --ms 560000 --input tools/play/full.input [--dump DIR]
#
# The run is deterministic (headless virtual clock): the random choices
# (roadblock cop, hall doors, bar quiz question) depend on the time of the
# calls, so changing the timing of an earlier line can change them.

# Title menu: JOGAR, then NOVO JOGO; the opening video ends in the bedroom.
22000 dump title
22000 click 290 345
+1500 click 370 412
+1000 wait 1fquarbo 200000
+1000 dump bedroom

